# Interpolation in a `call` kwarg value, with a format spec, and in the
# `call ... as` correlation ([LGRA.2.9.6.8]):
#
#   call light.turn_on entity_id: "light.{r.zone}.{r.level:02d}"
#        nocooldown as "corr-{r.id}"
#
# The `call` line carries the rendered correlation and arguments.
assert Reading id=1 zone=kitchen level=7
pump
assert Reading id=2 zone=hall level=12
pump
